WEBVTT

01:30.240 --> 01:32.704
[Episode 4]

01:38.016 --> 01:39.415
He is handsome.

01:39.415 --> 01:40.896
Good-looking.

01:40.896 --> 01:42.656
Elegant.

01:42.656 --> 01:44.295
Charming.

01:44.295 --> 01:45.575
Refined.

01:45.575 --> 01:46.816
Gentle-manlike.

01:46.816 --> 01:50.295
I've never ever met such a handsome man here.

01:50.295 --> 01:53.177
Look at how elegantly he eats the mutton!

01:53.177 --> 01:54.775
He must be from Jiangnan.

01:54.775 --> 01:58.456
He looks just like a refined gentleman
stepping out of a painting.

01:58.456 --> 02:00.935
He looks so refined while eating.

02:00.935 --> 02:04.295
A good-looking person
makes everything they do pleasing to the eye.

02:04.295 --> 02:05.855
I'll go invite him for a drink.

02:05.855 --> 02:06.935
I'll go.

02:06.935 --> 02:08.015
I'll go.

02:08.015 --> 02:09.376
I'll go.

02:09.376 --> 02:10.376
I'll go.

02:10.376 --> 02:11.376
- I'll go.
- I'll go.

02:20.976 --> 02:23.056
Bring my treasured grape wine
to that gentleman.

02:28.415 --> 02:30.575
- Please, young master.
- Please, young master.

02:30.575 --> 02:32.816
Please, ladies.

02:34.816 --> 02:35.816
Come back!

02:40.816 --> 02:41.816
No need to give him the wine.

02:45.575 --> 02:46.575
Ms. Yan.

02:48.816 --> 02:50.855
I was sorry to help Jiang Mei Er before.

02:50.855 --> 02:52.816
Please tell your father
not to cut off our business.

02:52.816 --> 02:55.217
My father said
that if I can't restore our business,

02:55.217 --> 02:56.895
he will break my legs.

02:56.895 --> 02:59.536
Please mercifully forgive me this once.

02:59.536 --> 03:00.536
It's too late.

03:00.536 --> 03:03.216
When you helped Jiang Mei Er,
you should have thought of the consequences.

03:04.336 --> 03:06.615
I was wrong. I made a stupid mistake.

03:06.615 --> 03:07.855
Show mercy, please!

03:07.855 --> 03:10.496
Get out! You're affecting my business.

03:13.096 --> 03:15.895
Yan Fu Zhi,
are you really going to drive me to my death?

03:15.895 --> 03:17.295
Jiang Mei Er was indeed right.

03:17.295 --> 03:19.256
You are also an evil woman,

03:19.256 --> 03:20.256
just like Meng Ting Hui.

03:20.256 --> 03:22.175
Both of you are ruthless and heartless.

03:24.295 --> 03:25.376
How dare you insult Meng like that!

03:25.376 --> 03:28.496
Today, I'll make you know what you'll get

03:28.496 --> 03:30.175
after offending an evil and ruthless woman.

03:31.855 --> 03:32.855
Get up!

03:37.056 --> 03:38.056
Help!

03:40.735 --> 03:42.855
If you set foot in Bofeng again,

03:42.855 --> 03:44.216
I'll beat you hard!

03:53.015 --> 03:54.015
Eat your food!

03:57.816 --> 04:01.056
You're beautiful yet so fierce and shrewish.

04:01.056 --> 04:04.175
You should
discipline your husband moderately.

04:04.175 --> 04:06.376
He isn't my husband. He's unfit for it.

04:06.376 --> 04:09.096
You're handsome yet brainless.

04:09.096 --> 04:10.735
All you know is to show off like a peacock
when you see a girl.

04:12.415 --> 04:13.895
Miss, what you said are hurtful.

04:15.136 --> 04:17.016
I was just kindly trying
to break up the fight.

04:17.016 --> 04:18.656
However, you have such a fiery temper.

04:18.656 --> 04:22.216
No wonder that gentleman
would rather get beaten than marry you.

04:22.216 --> 04:24.255
What? You get out too!

04:24.255 --> 04:27.855
Shut up, you playboy!
It's none of your business!

04:29.696 --> 04:31.136
Why can you make me leave?

04:32.815 --> 04:34.896
I am the boss of Bofeng.

04:34.896 --> 04:37.696
Now, get out!

04:40.336 --> 04:41.336
Get out!

04:43.615 --> 04:44.615
You...

04:46.136 --> 04:47.735
Get out!

04:47.735 --> 04:49.696
You really are shrewish and fierce.

04:49.696 --> 04:51.615
[Bofeng]
You are not allowed to come here again.

04:52.896 --> 04:53.896
Why can't I--

04:55.255 --> 04:57.137
Huang, why are you here?

04:57.137 --> 04:58.336
The young master ordered me to find you.

04:58.336 --> 05:00.415
Wait a moment, I need to reason with her.

05:00.415 --> 05:01.776
How dare she hit me with an abacus!

05:02.576 --> 05:05.656
Mr. Shen, you really can't mess with her.

05:06.976 --> 05:09.656
She's just a businesswoman.
What's so special about her?

05:09.656 --> 05:11.255
She is Meng Ting Hui's best friend.

05:12.255 --> 05:14.375
She even slashed at the young master
with a knife before.

05:16.815 --> 05:19.255
You mean our young master?

05:22.855 --> 05:23.855
Even so, can't I just stay away?

05:23.855 --> 05:24.855
Wait for me!

05:26.176 --> 05:29.776
[Shazhou Government Office]

05:29.776 --> 05:31.136
Sir, this way, please.

05:32.855 --> 05:34.536
As per Mr. Shen's instructions,

05:34.536 --> 05:37.935
we've arranged your accommodations
in the east wing of the government office.

05:37.935 --> 05:39.776
I will lead you there now.

05:41.776 --> 05:45.576
Which Mr. Shen are you talking about?

05:45.576 --> 05:46.576
That is me.

05:48.735 --> 05:49.735
Father.

05:49.735 --> 05:52.855
It's your handsome, refined,

05:52.855 --> 05:54.656
and graceful son.

05:54.656 --> 05:55.656
Shen Zhi Shu.

05:57.096 --> 05:58.096
Zhi Shu, you're here.

05:59.735 --> 06:02.256
My good son! Turn around.

06:02.256 --> 06:03.415
Let me take a good look at you.

06:04.576 --> 06:06.216
How dare you!

06:06.216 --> 06:07.935
You are so bold!

06:07.935 --> 06:09.495
How dare you assist His Majesty
in leaving the palace!

06:09.495 --> 06:11.615
You nearly endanger our Shen family!

06:12.415 --> 06:14.416
I'm just loyally serving His Majesty.

06:14.416 --> 06:15.656
Are you doing so?

06:15.656 --> 06:17.495
Our Shen family has been unblemished
for generations.

06:17.495 --> 06:20.096
How did I have a reckless son like you?

06:20.096 --> 06:21.536
- Father.
- Stop running!

06:21.536 --> 06:23.295
Father, I have an official position now!

06:23.295 --> 06:25.855
Beating a court official
is punishable by law!

06:25.855 --> 06:27.776
I'll beat you to death first
and then apologize to the late Emperor!

06:28.615 --> 06:29.615
Stop right there!

06:29.615 --> 06:30.776
Father!

06:30.776 --> 06:32.855
Put down your weapon immediately!

06:32.855 --> 06:34.336
If you kill me accidentally,

06:34.336 --> 06:35.856
there will be no one
to bury you after you die.

06:35.856 --> 06:37.536
How dare you curse your own father!

06:37.536 --> 06:39.255
You're done for!

06:39.255 --> 06:40.295
Don't move!

06:40.295 --> 06:41.375
Stop hiding!

06:41.375 --> 06:42.495
This is infuriating!

06:43.656 --> 06:44.776
Your Majesty.

06:44.776 --> 06:47.415
If you don't show up right now,
Zhi Shu will be beaten to death.

06:47.415 --> 06:48.776
No rush.

06:48.776 --> 06:52.935
I haven't seen such a warm scene
since I ascended the throne.

06:52.935 --> 06:54.295
- You unfilial son!
- Father!

06:54.295 --> 06:56.175
- I really--
- Don't hide!

06:56.175 --> 06:58.615
Stop watching!
If you don't show up, I'll be dead!

06:58.615 --> 07:00.495
Calling for help? I'll beat him too!

07:03.295 --> 07:06.495
Greetings, Your Majesty.

07:06.495 --> 07:08.415
You're as impressive as ever.

07:08.415 --> 07:10.055
Every strike is still accurate.

07:10.055 --> 07:12.935
Father, you kneel quite nimbly,
much more adept than beating me.

07:12.935 --> 07:13.935
Please rise quickly.

07:16.216 --> 07:18.656
It was my own decision to leave the palace.

07:18.656 --> 07:20.375
Zhi Shu just did as I commanded.

07:20.375 --> 07:23.216
If you blame him, I'll feel guilty.

07:24.375 --> 07:27.696
Since Your Majesty speaks for him,
I will forgive him this time.

07:28.416 --> 07:29.416
What you did in Shazhou

07:29.416 --> 07:31.815
is an open yet wise move.

07:31.815 --> 07:33.536
It not only stopped the misuse
of military equipment,

07:33.536 --> 07:36.656
but also brilliantly checked Lord Xu.

07:36.656 --> 07:40.016
You're as wise as the late Emperor.

07:40.016 --> 07:41.096
You flatter me.

07:42.495 --> 07:44.295
I have observed secretly for a long time.

07:44.295 --> 07:46.136
I deeply feel the tense situation
in the court.

07:47.576 --> 07:50.216
Your Majesty has few capable people
by your side.

07:50.216 --> 07:52.615
It is urgent to cultivate trusted confidants.

07:53.896 --> 07:55.375
Pei Jing He, Left Assistant Minister
of the Ministry of War,

07:55.375 --> 07:56.976
is virtuous, talented, and intelligent.

07:56.976 --> 08:00.055
But he is ostracized
because he hates Liu Ren's autocratic ways,

08:00.055 --> 08:02.055
with no real power.

08:02.055 --> 08:05.415
Now he can be used by Your Majesty.

08:05.415 --> 08:07.735
Although you're outside the court,

08:07.735 --> 08:09.735
you know the overall situation very well.

08:09.735 --> 08:11.175
The world is like a chessboard.

08:11.175 --> 08:12.615
Your Majesty is the player.

08:12.615 --> 08:14.055
Though I've retired,

08:14.055 --> 08:18.175
I'm willing to be Your Majesty's chess piece
for the stability of the nation.

08:18.175 --> 08:19.735
Now, among the six ministries,

08:19.735 --> 08:21.415
Xu Ting already controls four.

08:22.495 --> 08:25.216
The talented men selected
through the past imperial examinations

08:25.216 --> 08:27.055
have all worked for him.

08:27.976 --> 08:30.415
I now have no choice but to seek talent

08:30.415 --> 08:34.216
from the Imperial Exam for Women,
which he disdains to interfere with.

08:38.056 --> 08:41.296
Your Majesty, I have one more thing to say.

08:42.176 --> 08:44.976
As the saying goes,
a new emperor brings in new ministers.

08:44.976 --> 08:47.735
The power of the two chancellors
is growing day by day.

08:47.735 --> 08:51.015
If these two work together,
Your Majesty may find it hard to counter.

08:51.775 --> 08:54.056
Now Xu Ting is at the peak of his power,

08:54.056 --> 08:56.216
arousing Gu Qin's discontent.

08:56.216 --> 08:58.615
Your Majesty can turn this to your advantage.

09:00.576 --> 09:04.416
I need not elaborate on checks and balances.

09:11.296 --> 09:11.976
[Gu Mansion]

09:11.976 --> 09:14.056
Is this painting's brushwork insufficient,

09:14.056 --> 09:15.735
so it failed to be ranked top-grade?

09:16.416 --> 09:17.535
No.

09:17.535 --> 09:20.096
It only depicts still life
and lacks liveliness.

09:22.135 --> 09:23.135
Not so.

09:24.176 --> 09:25.176
Zhi Li is here.

09:41.696 --> 09:42.696
Sir.

09:48.296 --> 09:51.735
This painting is
of a dusk scene of the late spring.

09:51.735 --> 09:55.015
However, the flowers, trees,
and misty clouds in the painting

09:55.015 --> 09:58.696
are too bright and gaudy,
thus losing the sense of reality.

09:58.696 --> 10:01.096
In that case,
it will lose a vivid artistic flavor.

10:02.015 --> 10:04.336
The same goes for a person.
If a person is false, they are rotten inside.

10:05.495 --> 10:07.056
Zhi Li, have a seat.

10:09.775 --> 10:12.176
Zhi Li understands the teacher best.

10:13.096 --> 10:16.416
Zhi Li is quick-witted and careful.

10:16.416 --> 10:18.096
In the Imperial Exam for Women,

10:18.096 --> 10:20.696
with your talent, not to mention passing,

10:20.696 --> 10:23.176
even winning the top spot
will not be difficult.

10:25.416 --> 10:26.936
Sir, you passed the imperial examination
with high honors back then.

10:26.936 --> 10:28.336
When you first entered the Ministry of Works,

10:28.336 --> 10:30.855
you impressed the court
with your Water Control Strategy.

10:30.855 --> 10:33.375
Once implemented,
it solved the water disasters in Jiangnan.

10:33.375 --> 10:34.655
You relieved the people's worries.

10:34.655 --> 10:37.096
I'm willing to follow you,
become a court official,

10:37.096 --> 10:38.576
and work with you.

10:38.576 --> 10:41.176
But yesterday, my father said

10:41.176 --> 10:43.416
that Lord Xu strongly
opposes the Imperial Exam for Women.

10:43.416 --> 10:46.216
Even if women enter the court,
they cannot rise above the sixth rank.

10:46.216 --> 10:49.976
I'm afraid even if we pass the exam, we will
hardly have a chance to show our abilities.

10:53.655 --> 10:55.255
Talent is not judged by appearance.

10:55.255 --> 10:56.655
Men and women are equal.

10:56.655 --> 10:59.216
His Majesty overrode all objections
and reopened the Imperial Exam for Women.

10:59.216 --> 11:01.655
His desire to recruit talent is evident.

11:01.655 --> 11:03.576
When you enter the court in the future,

11:03.576 --> 11:07.416
as long as I am here,
I will certainly back you up.

11:10.176 --> 11:11.816
Sir, you are indeed a virtuous chancellor,

11:11.816 --> 11:13.255
seeking benefits for the people,

11:13.255 --> 11:14.416
paving paths for the humble,

11:14.416 --> 11:16.056
and also speaking for women.

11:16.056 --> 11:18.416
You're much more upright than Lord Xu.

11:19.336 --> 11:21.135
But he has a deep foundation in the court

11:21.135 --> 11:22.816
and holds the power of four ministries.

11:22.816 --> 11:25.375
I truly feel indignant for you.

11:25.375 --> 11:27.816
But I have never ever cared about power.

11:27.816 --> 11:29.056
I have been loyal to His Majesty.

11:29.056 --> 11:32.535
Even if His Majesty
entrusted all six ministries to Lord Xu,

11:32.535 --> 11:33.976
I would not mind.

11:35.135 --> 11:36.937
Sadly, His Majesty has ascended the throne,

11:36.937 --> 11:39.655
yet the whole nation
knows only the virtue of Lord Xu,

11:40.375 --> 11:42.375
but not the wisdom of His Majesty.

11:43.015 --> 11:45.576
People all say a virtuous chancellor is rare.

11:45.576 --> 11:47.655
And you're the only virtuous chancellor.

11:52.216 --> 11:54.655
I will assist His Majesty

11:54.655 --> 11:55.696
and create a new situation.

11:56.496 --> 12:00.096
And then, women can also
hold their heads high in the court.

12:02.855 --> 12:04.976
We will keep your teaching

12:04.976 --> 12:06.576
in mind.

12:11.976 --> 12:13.416
[Imperial Examination Hall]
Zhao Chun Nuan.

12:13.416 --> 12:14.416
Yes.

12:17.056 --> 12:18.495
Xie Yun Xi.

12:18.495 --> 12:19.495
Yes.

12:20.216 --> 12:22.615
Meng, did you see that?

12:22.615 --> 12:25.176
She just took a whole box of ink.

12:27.176 --> 12:30.375
Are you here to accompany me
or to watch the fun?

12:31.135 --> 12:33.495
Of course, I'm here to root for you.

12:33.495 --> 12:36.096
Last night, I dreamed
that you topped the candidate list.

12:37.936 --> 12:39.655
I was so happy and woke up laughing.

12:39.655 --> 12:40.655
Please, Fu Zhi.

12:41.936 --> 12:42.936
After that, I couldn't fall asleep.

12:42.936 --> 12:44.816
So I just got up
and made you apricot skin cakes.

12:44.816 --> 12:46.495
They're right here, and you...

12:50.015 --> 12:51.015
I forgot to bring them.

12:51.936 --> 12:53.176
I'll eat them after the exam.

12:54.456 --> 12:56.135
Meng Ting Hui.

12:56.135 --> 12:57.135
Yes.

12:59.096 --> 13:00.375
Go back and wait for me.

13:00.375 --> 13:02.135
I'll be waiting right here.
I won't go anywhere.

13:02.135 --> 13:03.655
Meng, I have confidence in you.
You are the best in my eyes.

13:03.655 --> 13:05.456
Don't be nervous.
Provincial Exam is easy for you.

13:05.456 --> 13:06.816
You'll ace it.

13:06.816 --> 13:08.015
Fu Zhi.

13:08.015 --> 13:09.296
If you keep talking, I'll get dizzy.

13:09.296 --> 13:10.296
I'll keep my mouth shut.

13:12.015 --> 13:13.495
Meng Ting Hui.

13:23.375 --> 13:24.375
Meng.

13:37.375 --> 13:39.456
The Provincial Exam begins.

14:56.704 --> 14:59.904
[Capital Boundary]

15:02.855 --> 15:03.855
We've reached the capital boundary.

15:03.855 --> 15:05.015
Your Majesty.

15:05.015 --> 15:06.096
Return to the palace immediately.

15:06.096 --> 15:07.096
Yes.

15:09.096 --> 15:10.096
Keep up.

15:26.855 --> 15:28.296
Your Majesty.

15:28.296 --> 15:30.176
I have been waiting here for a long time.

15:30.176 --> 15:31.176
Thank you.

15:41.344 --> 15:46.946
[Shazhou]

15:57.736 --> 16:00.696
Today, His Majesty will end his seclusion.

16:00.696 --> 16:02.135
It's already noon.

16:02.135 --> 16:04.255
Why hasn't His Majesty shown up yet?

16:04.255 --> 16:06.895
It's quite strange. Even Lord Gu hasn't come.

16:06.895 --> 16:07.895
Insolent!

16:13.976 --> 16:17.735
How dare you make noise
before the Sacred Ancestral Hall!

16:34.655 --> 16:37.895
It's such an important event,

16:37.895 --> 16:40.296
and you're actually late!

16:40.936 --> 16:42.015
What a disgrace!

16:43.296 --> 16:45.176
I'm sorry, Lord Xu.

16:50.375 --> 16:53.655
<i>Last night,
the scouts saw His Majesty return.</i>

16:54.296 --> 16:55.296
<i>Could it be...</i>

17:16.656 --> 17:20.376
His Majesty has ended his seclusion!

17:21.295 --> 17:23.856
Greetings, Your Majesty.

17:23.856 --> 17:26.376
May Your Majesty be blessed.

17:27.376 --> 17:28.735
All of you, rise.

17:36.376 --> 17:39.416
Lord Xu,
you have more white hair above your ears.

17:40.656 --> 17:42.656
It seems during my ten days of seclusion,

17:42.656 --> 17:47.616
you've worked very hard
in managing state affairs.

17:48.456 --> 17:50.696
I do what I should do.

17:52.376 --> 17:53.815
I do trivial things,

17:53.815 --> 17:58.416
while Your Majesty thought of
how to govern the country.

17:59.656 --> 18:03.176
Do you know what I've gotten?

18:03.176 --> 18:06.136
I have had the honor
of serving three Emperors,

18:06.136 --> 18:10.015
and I have some insights into court affairs.

18:10.015 --> 18:12.055
I guess

18:12.055 --> 18:13.295
that Your Majesty

18:14.096 --> 18:18.055
has read the governing strategies
left by the late Emperor.

18:18.856 --> 18:21.735
Very smart of you, Lord Xu.

18:22.575 --> 18:24.216
You truly understand me.

18:28.176 --> 18:31.136
Your Majesty, there is an urgent report.

18:31.136 --> 18:32.335
Please review it, Your Majesty.

18:47.896 --> 18:49.936
This matter is of great importance.

18:51.015 --> 18:54.976
Chief Eunuch You,
lead the ministers to the main hall and wait.

18:54.976 --> 18:56.815
Gu Qin and I will be there later.

18:56.815 --> 18:57.815
Yes.

19:27.015 --> 19:30.015
How dare you snore here! What a disgrace!

19:31.376 --> 19:33.136
It's already very late.

19:33.136 --> 19:34.735
I've drunk too much tea.

19:34.735 --> 19:36.815
When will His Majesty arrive?

19:36.815 --> 19:39.216
My lords, please be patient.

19:39.216 --> 19:40.495
His Majesty will be here soon.

19:41.535 --> 19:42.856
Lord Xu.

19:42.856 --> 19:44.856
His Majesty is considerate of your old age

19:44.856 --> 19:46.295
and specially prepared a chair for you.

20:19.575 --> 20:23.015
Gu Qin, what did you talk
with His Majesty about?

20:23.656 --> 20:26.376
His Majesty arrives.

20:55.216 --> 20:56.216
Thank you, Your Majesty.

21:26.456 --> 21:29.015
All of you have worked late into the night.

21:29.616 --> 21:31.015
Thank you for your hard work.

21:31.015 --> 21:32.936
When I was in ten-day seclusion,

21:32.936 --> 21:34.696
Lord Xu managed the state affairs.

21:35.456 --> 21:37.535
I have specially prepared a generous gift.

21:37.535 --> 21:38.535
Get it in!

21:43.360 --> 21:45.504
[Capable Minister of State]

21:52.176 --> 21:54.176
What does Your Majesty mean by this?

21:54.176 --> 21:57.255
Do you know
that your trusted man, Ding Chong,

21:58.015 --> 22:00.856
used the plaque personally inscribed by you
as a protective talisman,

22:00.856 --> 22:04.136
cheated and oppressed the people in Shazhou,

22:04.136 --> 22:05.696
and acted tyrannically?

22:05.696 --> 22:08.055
Your Majesty, Ding Chong told me personally

22:08.055 --> 22:10.856
that he has been shielded
by Lord Xu all these years.

22:10.856 --> 22:12.976
[Testimony of Magistrate Wang in Shazhou]
This is his criminal evidence.

22:15.535 --> 22:16.696
Absurd!

22:16.696 --> 22:19.255
Official-mafia collusion,
selling military equipment?

22:20.095 --> 22:23.575
I know nothing about Ding Chong's actions!

22:23.575 --> 22:25.216
And I've never shielded him.

22:25.216 --> 22:28.856
Wasn't his plaque inscribed by you?

22:28.856 --> 22:32.735
But I can tell
this is indeed your handwriting.

22:38.335 --> 22:39.616
Your Majesty.

22:40.255 --> 22:42.416
Lord Xu's men are spread
throughout the Ning Empire.

22:42.416 --> 22:44.856
Inevitably,
corrupt officials exploit his inscriptions,

22:44.856 --> 22:47.735
and this is not what Lord Xu wants.

22:48.815 --> 22:50.616
Moreover, Shazhou is remote,

22:50.616 --> 22:52.775
and Lord Xu always works very hard

22:52.775 --> 22:53.776
for our nation.

22:53.776 --> 22:56.656
Ding Chong's acts of deception
have nothing to do with Lord Xu.

22:58.735 --> 23:01.095
Your Majesty,
I'm in charge of the Ministry of War.

23:01.095 --> 23:03.457
Ding Chong, a treacherous guy,
made a mistake at work.

23:03.457 --> 23:06.255
As his leader,
I'm to blame for my negligence.

23:06.255 --> 23:07.856
It has nothing to do with Lord Xu.

23:07.856 --> 23:10.335
I merely asked one question.

23:10.335 --> 23:13.335
You all defended him.

23:13.335 --> 23:15.055
Is it that I am wrong,

23:15.055 --> 23:17.495
or that Lord Xu cannot be questioned?

23:17.495 --> 23:20.176
Your Majesty, I've served three Emperors.

23:20.176 --> 23:22.055
I swear I'm loyal to our nation.

23:22.735 --> 23:27.896
One of my legs was injured by Zhongwan people
while I tried to protect the late Emperor,

23:27.896 --> 23:28.976
affecting my walking.

23:29.976 --> 23:33.696
I rely on my absolute loyalty
and numerous achievements

23:33.696 --> 23:35.376
to earn the respect of all officials.

23:35.376 --> 23:38.216
Your Majesty, when you were in Shazhou,

23:38.216 --> 23:40.136
I don't know who deceived you,

23:40.136 --> 23:42.136
or what slanderous whispers you heard

23:42.136 --> 23:45.295
that made Your Majesty so dissatisfied
and suspicious of me.

23:45.936 --> 23:48.376
What are you talking about?

23:49.177 --> 23:52.495
I have been in seclusion for ten days
in the Sacred Ancestral Hall.

23:52.495 --> 23:55.735
I tried to figure out how to govern.
When did I go to Shazhou?

23:57.897 --> 24:01.055
It seems that Your Majesty

24:01.055 --> 24:04.976
learned quite a bit about lying
in a remote place.

24:04.976 --> 24:09.495
I remember I did go to Shazhou ten years ago.

24:09.495 --> 24:12.335
Are you perhaps confusing old memories?

24:12.335 --> 24:13.495
I have a witness.

24:13.495 --> 24:15.456
- Where is the witness?
- Shen Zhi Shu.

24:15.456 --> 24:17.815
Zhi Shu, have you been to Shazhou?

24:17.815 --> 24:20.416
Yes, Your Majesty.

24:21.815 --> 24:23.936
I was ordered by Your Majesty
to inspect Shazhou

24:23.936 --> 24:25.575
and witnessed the chaos there
with my own eyes.

24:25.575 --> 24:27.936
I've brought back evidence
against Ding Chong and others.

24:27.936 --> 24:29.416
How dare you, Shen Zhi Shu!

24:29.416 --> 24:32.015
That night in the Sacred Ancestral Hall,
you impersonated His Majesty,

24:32.015 --> 24:34.616
and it was I who drove you to Shazhou
to bring His Majesty back.

24:34.616 --> 24:36.136
Lord Xu, watch your words.

24:36.136 --> 24:38.495
Breaking into the Sacred Ancestral Hall
is a grave crime.

24:38.495 --> 24:40.575
You don't have to
add another crime on yourself

24:40.575 --> 24:43.775
just to frame me and Shen Zhi Shu.

24:43.775 --> 24:44.976
Your Majesty, please calm down.

24:44.976 --> 24:49.095
Lord Xu is old,
and it's inevitable to misremember something.

24:53.616 --> 24:58.815
So, Your Majesty set up a trap for me?

24:58.815 --> 25:00.656
That's not true, Lord Xu.

25:00.656 --> 25:02.735
Your Majesty,
I've investigated for a long time

25:02.735 --> 25:04.015
and finally obtained solid evidence.

25:04.015 --> 25:06.896
Wang Qi, the Military Governor of Shazhou,
disregarded military regulations.

25:06.896 --> 25:08.416
Without General Gao Meng's knowledge,

25:08.416 --> 25:10.176
he colluded with Liu Ren,
the Minister of War,

25:10.176 --> 25:12.095
to embezzle 300,000 taels of military funds.

25:12.095 --> 25:14.696
Wang Qi and Gao Meng are now waiting outside.

25:14.696 --> 25:16.376
They can confront Mr. Liu right now

25:16.376 --> 25:17.775
to clarify the facts.

25:17.775 --> 25:19.335
- Summon them.
- Summon them.

25:22.535 --> 25:24.976
- Your Majesty, I'm guilty.
- Your Majesty, I'm guilty.

25:27.656 --> 25:28.656
Your Majesty.

25:29.335 --> 25:30.696
I made a mistake.

25:30.696 --> 25:31.775
I'm guilty.

25:31.775 --> 25:32.976
I beg Your Majesty for mercy.

25:32.976 --> 25:35.456
Your Majesty, show mercy!

25:36.896 --> 25:38.136
Lord Xu.

25:38.136 --> 25:41.255
Liu Ren held a key position,
but colluded with a border general,

25:41.255 --> 25:44.255
committed corruption,
and affected military affairs.

25:44.255 --> 25:46.015
Now with both witnesses
and material evidence,

25:46.656 --> 25:48.656
how should he be dealt with
according to the law?

25:48.656 --> 25:50.136
Your Majesty,

25:50.136 --> 25:53.095
according to the Laws of Ning Empire,
he should be flogged 100 times

25:53.095 --> 25:55.295
and dismissed from office.
And all his property shall be confiscated.

25:55.295 --> 25:56.976
But considering Liu Ren has worked
for many years--

25:56.976 --> 25:58.495
Approved.

25:58.495 --> 26:00.696
Do as Lord Xu suggested.

26:00.696 --> 26:03.295
Immediately dismiss Liu Ren and punish him.

26:03.295 --> 26:04.575
Wang Qi, as Military Governor,

26:04.575 --> 26:05.735
sold military equipment

26:05.735 --> 26:07.055
and bribed court officials.

26:07.055 --> 26:08.575
He shall be sentenced to immediate execution.

26:08.575 --> 26:10.775
Although Gao Meng is not mainly involved,

26:10.775 --> 26:13.376
he cannot escape responsibility
for poor supervision

26:13.376 --> 26:14.656
and is demoted by one rank.

26:14.656 --> 26:16.416
He will temporarily remain in the army
to redeem himself by good service.

26:16.416 --> 26:21.416
All military officials involved in this case
should be strictly investigated

26:21.416 --> 26:23.335
with no leniency.

26:37.055 --> 26:38.055
Your Majesty.

26:38.055 --> 26:40.616
The position of Minister of War is crucial.

26:40.616 --> 26:41.656
It cannot be vacant.

26:41.656 --> 26:43.735
Pei Jing He, the Left Assistant Minister
of the Ministry of War,

26:43.735 --> 26:45.936
is a capable man,
who was selected through the Imperial Exam.

26:45.936 --> 26:47.896
But he was ostracized

26:47.896 --> 26:49.095
because he
opposed Liu Ren's autocratic actions.

26:49.095 --> 26:51.656
He was sent
to a nominal post like military supervisor,

26:51.656 --> 26:52.815
without real power.

26:52.815 --> 26:57.535
Immediately summon him back
to temporarily serve as the Minister of War.

26:57.535 --> 27:00.976
Your Majesty,
this position carries great responsibility.

27:00.976 --> 27:04.255
Such a hasty appointment may be improper.

27:04.255 --> 27:06.696
Then let Gu Qin personally supervise it.

27:06.696 --> 27:08.735
Just give rewards for merits
and punishments for faults.

27:08.735 --> 27:12.936
I will do my best
and live up to Your Majesty's trust.

27:12.936 --> 27:13.936
Good.

27:18.376 --> 27:20.255
It is settled then.

27:20.255 --> 27:21.815
Listen, all of you,

27:21.815 --> 27:23.936
exercise more to keep energetic.

27:24.815 --> 27:29.496
After all, you'll work late often.

27:29.496 --> 27:30.496
Your Majesty.

27:30.496 --> 27:32.055
Farewell, Your Majesty.

27:32.055 --> 27:33.815
Farewell, Your Majesty.

27:40.832 --> 27:42.856
[Porridge distribution]

27:42.856 --> 27:45.856
Ms. Yan's good friend, Meng Ting Hui,
got first place in the Provincial Exam.

27:45.856 --> 27:47.535
To celebrate it,
we'll give free porridge for three days.

27:53.376 --> 27:54.896
There's enough for everyone. Don't worry.

27:57.055 --> 27:58.376
Here.

27:58.376 --> 27:59.656
Take it easy.

27:59.656 --> 28:00.656
No rush. Everyone will get some.

28:01.344 --> 28:03.376
[Cold medicine]

28:03.376 --> 28:06.495
The weather is cold,
so Ms. Yan offers everyone cold medicine.

28:06.495 --> 28:09.055
Get some to avoid catching a cold.

28:09.055 --> 28:10.856
- Here, take it.
- What a great person!

28:10.856 --> 28:11.856
Thank you.

28:16.495 --> 28:17.495
Father.

28:19.696 --> 28:20.696
Be careful.

28:20.696 --> 28:23.295
It's Meng Ting Hui who got first place,
not you.

28:23.295 --> 28:25.176
Why are you celebrating for her?

28:25.176 --> 28:27.495
It's disgraceful. I'm ashamed of you.

28:27.495 --> 28:28.495
Come back with me.

28:30.376 --> 28:32.095
Now that Bofeng is profitable,

28:32.095 --> 28:33.495
I can do whatever I want.

28:33.495 --> 28:35.255
When spring comes,
I will accompany Meng to Metropolitan Exam.

28:35.255 --> 28:36.735
I'll go with her to the capital
to extend my business.

28:36.735 --> 28:38.535
You will actually go to the capital with her!

28:39.816 --> 28:42.255
You're out of your mind!

28:42.255 --> 28:43.976
I'm very disappointed in you.

28:44.696 --> 28:45.696
My dear!

28:46.775 --> 28:50.535
Although Fu Zhi is a girl,
she has her own ideas.

28:50.535 --> 28:52.416
Don't listen to those old women's rumors

28:52.416 --> 28:54.936
that no man wants a woman working outside.

28:54.936 --> 28:58.656
Even if Fu Zhi never marries,
we can afford to support her.

28:58.656 --> 29:00.216
Not marry?

29:00.216 --> 29:03.535
Is she going to hang around
with Meng Ting Hui for life?

29:03.535 --> 29:05.735
Children's marriage is arranged by parents.

29:05.735 --> 29:07.535
So I'll decide who she marries.

29:08.335 --> 29:09.335
Fu Zhi.

29:10.136 --> 29:12.815
I'll talk to your father about your marriage.

29:14.575 --> 29:15.976
Don't be angry with him anymore.

29:19.656 --> 29:20.656
My dear.

29:21.696 --> 29:22.696
My dear.

29:26.255 --> 29:27.535
- My dear.
- My dear.

29:27.535 --> 29:28.535
Are you alright?

29:28.535 --> 29:31.775
I fell accidentally. It's not Fu Zhi's fault.

29:31.775 --> 29:35.095
After all these years,
your ways of framing others haven't changed.

29:35.095 --> 29:36.095
You!

29:37.856 --> 29:38.856
Meng.

29:38.856 --> 29:40.416
Meng Ting Hui.

29:40.416 --> 29:42.136
How dare you stop me!

29:42.136 --> 29:43.136
- I'm warning you!
- I...

29:43.896 --> 29:45.055
I'm already the Jieyuan.

29:45.055 --> 29:46.735
I don't need to bow even to the Governor.

29:46.735 --> 29:48.216
If you slap me,

29:48.216 --> 29:51.656
aren't you afraid all people in Shazhou
will talk about your rude action?

29:51.656 --> 29:56.936
I can do nothing with you,
but can't I discipline my own daughter?

29:56.936 --> 29:58.976
Someone, take Fu Zhi back!

29:58.976 --> 30:00.416
- Meng.
- Hold on.

30:01.056 --> 30:04.176
I've told the interim inspector of Shazhou

30:04.176 --> 30:06.015
about your selfless decisions.

30:06.015 --> 30:08.535
To celebrate the exam results,
you'll give porridge for three days.

30:09.136 --> 30:11.815
And you've allowed your daughter
to go to the capital with me.

30:12.416 --> 30:14.055
This is utter nonsense!

30:24.735 --> 30:26.255
By order of the inspector,

30:26.255 --> 30:28.896
we congratulate Miss Meng on your success.

30:28.896 --> 30:31.416
Thank you very much.

30:31.416 --> 30:34.616
The inspector presents the Yan family
with a banner of Honored Family

30:34.616 --> 30:36.656
to commend their kindness.

30:41.735 --> 30:43.535
Thank you very much.

30:43.535 --> 30:45.616
Thank you.

30:45.616 --> 30:46.696
Meng Ting Hui.

30:47.575 --> 30:49.055
You won.

30:49.055 --> 30:50.176
Thank you, Mrs. Yan.

30:51.216 --> 30:52.735
Please tell the inspector

30:52.735 --> 30:54.055
that Mrs. Yan decided

30:54.055 --> 30:56.897
- to copy scriptures 1,000 times--
- 10,000 times.

30:56.897 --> 30:59.176
No, 10,000 times, for me and Fu Zhi

30:59.176 --> 31:02.136
to pray for a smooth journey to the capital.

31:02.136 --> 31:03.136
Nonsense!

31:11.552 --> 31:14.112
[Honored Family]

31:17.335 --> 31:18.416
Thank you, Mr. Yan.

31:25.495 --> 31:27.176
Thank you for your kindness.

31:27.176 --> 31:28.735
Meng, I'm so lucky!

31:28.735 --> 31:30.535
I can go to the capital with you!

31:31.775 --> 31:35.095
I asked the inspector
to send the banner in advance.

31:35.095 --> 31:37.936
I knew your father and stepmother
would try to stop you.

31:38.977 --> 31:41.095
Meng, you're so good to me!

31:41.095 --> 31:43.735
I'm so lucky to meet you.

31:45.376 --> 31:46.376
People are watching.

31:54.255 --> 31:55.255
<i>Xiang.</i>

31:56.456 --> 31:58.896
<i>I brought you
your favorite apricot skin cakes.</i>

32:02.015 --> 32:03.176
<i>I miss you so much.</i>

32:04.976 --> 32:07.015
<i>I miss you holding me in the cage.</i>

32:07.656 --> 32:09.055
[Tomb of Xiang]
<i>We kept each other warm.</i>

32:11.575 --> 32:13.295
<i>I miss you playing the flute for me.</i>

32:14.335 --> 32:17.616
<i>You taught me your favorite tune.</i>

32:20.255 --> 32:22.575
<i>That place was like hell,</i>

32:23.656 --> 32:24.656
<i>but you were there.</i>

32:26.176 --> 32:27.535
<i>Wherever you were was my home.</i>

32:31.015 --> 32:32.255
<i>Xiang.</i>

32:34.055 --> 32:35.815
<i>I hate that I was too weak.</i>

32:38.176 --> 32:40.775
<i>I hate that I couldn't protect you back then.</i>

32:48.775 --> 32:49.775
Ting Hui.

32:51.176 --> 32:52.976
You must escape from here.

32:54.376 --> 32:55.656
As far as possible.

32:56.416 --> 32:59.535
Xiang, hold on!

33:00.216 --> 33:02.335
We will definitely escape from here.

33:02.335 --> 33:04.136
We will definitely survive.

33:39.015 --> 33:40.015
Xiang.

33:42.176 --> 33:43.176
Xiang.

33:45.735 --> 33:46.936
Xiang.

33:49.095 --> 33:50.335
Xiang.

33:51.735 --> 33:53.936
Xiang, say something.

33:53.936 --> 33:55.136
Xiang.

33:57.335 --> 34:00.295
What's wrong? Don't scare me.

34:01.095 --> 34:02.535
Xiang.

34:09.015 --> 34:10.816
Hold on, Xiang.

34:43.296 --> 34:44.976
You brat!

35:00.336 --> 35:01.816
How dare you mess with me!

35:02.615 --> 35:04.015
Both of you just die!

35:06.535 --> 35:07.535
Finish her off!

36:08.215 --> 36:09.256
Xiang.

36:10.856 --> 36:15.095
Shazhou has already changed now.

36:16.856 --> 36:20.256
Those evil people
finally got their retribution.

36:25.816 --> 36:26.816
Xiang.

36:28.376 --> 36:29.776
I have never forgotten the promise

36:31.095 --> 36:32.416
between us.

36:35.520 --> 36:38.535
[Jieyuan of Shazhou]

36:38.535 --> 36:39.535
Look.

36:40.936 --> 36:42.215
I went to a Women's Academy.

36:43.215 --> 36:44.336
I got first place in the Provincial Exam.

36:45.095 --> 36:47.495
I'm about to go to the capital
to take the Metropolitan Exam.

36:49.175 --> 36:51.736
I hear the palace walls there are very high,

36:51.736 --> 36:53.135
and the palace is very big.

36:53.816 --> 36:55.055
But there must be a place

36:56.376 --> 36:58.495
to fulfill our shared aspirations.

37:01.632 --> 37:02.734
[Jieyuan of Shazhou]

37:07.896 --> 37:10.615
I will be a court official.

37:12.376 --> 37:14.376
[Tomb of Xiang]
I must make myself strong.

37:18.256 --> 37:19.695
I will protect Fu Zhi.

37:22.336 --> 37:24.535
I will protect the people around me.

37:27.816 --> 37:29.095
I will make our nation a place

37:30.215 --> 37:33.055
where no one can trample on others at will.

37:37.095 --> 37:40.495
I will let people like you and me

37:43.776 --> 37:45.976
be bathed in the bright light.

37:49.575 --> 37:50.575
Ting Hui.

37:51.896 --> 37:53.776
Walk toward the light.

37:55.535 --> 37:57.296
You must survive.

38:09.015 --> 38:10.015
Xiang.

38:10.776 --> 38:14.575
I'm afraid
I won't be able to visit you for a long time.

38:15.695 --> 38:20.336
If you miss me,
please come to my dreams often.

38:33.015 --> 38:35.015
I hear the capital is very damp,

38:35.015 --> 38:36.896
so I brought you
a moisture-proof rhino horn pillow.

38:37.856 --> 38:41.015
Fu Zhi, are you accompanying me
to the exam or moving house?

38:41.015 --> 38:42.095
Meng.

38:42.095 --> 38:44.095
We are new in the capital,

38:44.095 --> 38:46.816
so I must make sure you're comfortable there.

38:46.816 --> 38:49.575
Meng, I'm ready. Let's set off.

38:49.575 --> 38:51.095
So ostentatious.

38:51.095 --> 38:53.055
Aren't you afraid of bandits on the way?

38:53.055 --> 38:54.655
[Metropolitan Exam Permit]
We have a shield.

38:55.695 --> 38:58.056
Unless those bandits are tired of living,

38:58.056 --> 38:59.695
they won't dare rob a top candidate
in the Provincial Exam.

38:59.695 --> 39:01.736
I must make sure
my most beloved Meng leaves Shazhou

39:01.736 --> 39:04.257
- in an impressive way.
- It'll be a long trip.

39:04.257 --> 39:05.575
Don't worry.

39:05.575 --> 39:08.736
Nobody will block your way to the capital.

39:08.736 --> 39:10.296
We will surely arrive smoothly.

39:14.416 --> 39:16.936
Capital, we're coming!

39:16.936 --> 39:19.575
We're coming!

39:22.304 --> 39:25.760
[Metropolitan Exam Permit]

39:27.456 --> 39:28.456
Come back safely.

39:45.215 --> 39:46.215
Your Majesty.

39:47.495 --> 39:48.856
Here is what you want.

39:50.256 --> 39:51.256
How so?

39:53.215 --> 39:54.575
The list of successful candidates

39:54.575 --> 39:56.736
is the key for Your Majesty
to defeat Lord Xu, right?

39:58.240 --> 39:59.240
[List of candidates]

40:00.296 --> 40:01.535
Not bad.

40:01.535 --> 40:03.575
Shen Zhi Li got first place in the capital.

40:04.575 --> 40:06.655
Of course,
with the bloodline of our Shen family.

40:06.655 --> 40:08.175
You didn't take the exam, yet she did.

40:08.175 --> 40:09.976
Don't you feel ashamed?

40:09.976 --> 40:10.976
Exactly.

40:12.095 --> 40:13.095
Keep your mouth shut.

40:19.376 --> 40:20.575
Meng Ting Hui?

40:21.896 --> 40:24.095
She actually got first place in Shazhou!

40:24.095 --> 40:28.055
You mean Miss Meng
who solved the case with you in Shazhou?

40:28.055 --> 40:29.535
A tough person

40:29.535 --> 40:31.135
should play a key role.

40:31.135 --> 40:33.095
Xu Ting's men are spread
throughout the six ministries.

40:33.095 --> 40:37.695
The Imperial Exam is a good opportunity
for me to select useful people.

40:37.695 --> 40:40.376
This time,
I'll definitely defeat that old fool.

40:42.336 --> 40:45.256
Here's her chance.

40:45.256 --> 40:46.376
Let's see how she takes it to soar high.

40:57.176 --> 40:59.535
The shops here are busier
than those in Shazhou.

40:59.535 --> 41:01.695
We must walk around later.

41:01.695 --> 41:03.296
I've long heard
about the capital's prosperity.

41:03.296 --> 41:06.095
Now I realize
I just learned a little about it from books.

41:06.095 --> 41:07.376
Fu Zhi.

41:07.376 --> 41:10.095
I hear the Huiyin House is
on this Changle Street.

41:10.095 --> 41:11.575
Its owner is exactly Situ Xue.

41:11.575 --> 41:12.575
How do you know?

41:13.535 --> 41:16.015
Without thorough preparation,
how could I impersonate her well?

41:20.055 --> 41:22.376
Capital, we've really made it!

41:23.215 --> 41:24.856
My name is Yan Fu Zhi.

41:24.856 --> 41:26.736
Her name is Meng Ting Hui.

41:26.736 --> 41:29.495
Capital, here we come!

41:31.095 --> 41:32.095
People are watching.

41:40.175 --> 41:41.495
Welcome!

41:41.495 --> 41:43.095
Welcome!

41:43.095 --> 41:44.535
Welcome!

41:44.535 --> 41:45.856
Welcome!

41:45.856 --> 41:47.296
Welcome!

41:47.296 --> 41:48.776
Welcome!

41:48.776 --> 41:49.776
Stop!

41:50.936 --> 41:52.936
Welcome, both of you!

41:53.655 --> 41:54.655
Shun.

41:55.976 --> 41:58.575
Come on in, and may you succeed.

41:58.575 --> 41:59.626
[Come on in, and May You Succeed]

42:02.376 --> 42:03.976
Listen up, Madam.

42:03.976 --> 42:06.296
This is the Jieyuan from Shazhou!

42:06.296 --> 42:08.055
What a surprise!

42:08.055 --> 42:10.655
It's an honor to have you here!

42:10.655 --> 42:13.816
My guests are all female candidates
for the Metropolitan Exam.

42:13.816 --> 42:16.937
There's only one best room left.

42:16.937 --> 42:19.175
Shun, show the honored guest inside.

42:20.215 --> 42:21.215
- Come on in, please.
- Come on in, please.

42:22.696 --> 42:23.696
Don't forget my tavern

42:23.696 --> 42:26.015
if you pass the exam.

42:26.015 --> 42:27.015
[Chunman House]
Be careful!

43:07.416 --> 43:09.575
